      "label": "Three female lawmakers standing together at a press conference",
      "description": "The scene depicts three female lawmakers, known as 'The Squad', standing side by side in front of official U.S. House of Representatives banners and flags. They are positioned in a row, with the woman on the left, the woman in the center wearing a white headwrap, and the woman on the right at a podium. The text overlay labels them as 'the lawmakers known as \"the squad\"', indicating a political context. The spatial arrangement suggests a formal event, likely a press conference or public statement.",
