      "description": "A term used to refer to a group of four progressive Democratic congresswomen in the U.S. House of Representatives: Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez, Rashida Tlaib, Ilhan Omar, and Ayanna Pressley. The term was popularized by conservative media and political opponents as a pejorative label to imply they are a unified, disruptive, or un-American group. The meme uses this term to demean and dehumanize them, fitting the hateful intent described in the overall intent instance.",
