      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "contempt",
      "label": "contemptuous emotion",
      "description": "The overall expression conveyed by the meme is one of contempt and disdain, primarily through the use of the derogatory label 'the squad' which implies the lawmakers are untrustworthy, disruptive, and un-American. The visual presentation of the lawmakers smiling and appearing confident at a formal press conference contrasts with the hateful intent of the label, creating an emotional tension that underscores the contemptuous message.",
